          "type": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "In the adventure sport of paragliding, athletes fly free while using a gliding craft without any fixed parts. Because the participant will be accompanied by a qualified co-pilot, no prior training is necessary. The paraglider must be at least 6 years old and weigh no more than 95 kg to participate in paragliding. Pregnant women, persons with heart problems, sinus problems, lung problems, ear infections, and claustrophobia should avoid paragliding. The whole length of the paragliding includes the instructor briefing, strapping on and off of the safety harness, and real flying time. Enjoy the exhilaration of paragliding in the Meghalayan sky as you take in Nongjrong from the perspective of a bird. A once-in-a-lifetime experience, gliding between snow-capped peaks, an expanse of clear blue sky, and breathtaking views of the valleys all around you. Engage in this fascinating sport under the supervision of a competent teacher to ensure a great encounter! And have memorable adventures while paragliding in Nongjrong. As of now Paragliding is not available in Nongjrong but it will be open soon, and one paragliding will be available in Nongjrong we would publish in this page."
